    "domain_forces": [
      "The 30-day skill purge cascaded away a retired publication whose name the 90-day hold still reserved, so the old address stopped answering withdrawn and the name could be reused early."
    ],
    "decision": "Add a skill hold read owned by publishing to the deletion sweep only.",
