      "A deleted skill is purged only after its grace.",
      "A deleted skill's publication name is held ninety days."
    ],
    "rejected_alternatives": [
      "ON DELETE SET NULL on publications.skill_id: the hold would outlive the skill but the withdrawn address would lose what it points at."
    ],
